# Claude Code — per-user / runtime state.
# 2026-05-12: selectively un-ignored .claude/agents/ and .claude/workflows/
# so the agent definitions + workflow runbooks ship with the repo (every
# contributor and every future agent session sees the same prompts +
# checklists). Per-user state (settings.local.json, worktrees, memory,
# plans, reports) stays local.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/workflows/

