# Local scratch / prompt notes (never committed)
miladyApp.txt
*.scratch.md

# 2026-05-12: 3dStructure.md and GameFeatures.md were marked as "Working
# drafts" here but they're treated as canonical by CLAUDE.md and
# WorldContent.md. They're now tracked. Re-adding them here will silently
# break the doc system — see CLAUDE.md "CANONICAL DOCS" section.
#
# AgentHosting.md never materialised; improvements.md was archived to
# docs/archive/design-notes/improvements.md. Both stay ignored.
AgentHosting.md
improvements.md

# Sub-agent memory index files accidentally written to repo root.
# These belong under .claude/memory/<agent>/ — pinning here so they stop
# polluting git status when an agent writes one to the wrong path.
/MEMORY.md

# Draco compression originals — pre-compression GLB backups. Git history
# already holds the original uncompressed versions, so revert is a
# `git checkout <sha> -- <file>.glb`. These are ~17MB of local-only restore
# material and shouldn't bloat the repo.
apps/web/public/models/.draco-backup/
# WebP texture compression originals — same rationale as .draco-backup above.
apps/web/public/models/.webp-backup/
# KTX2 compression originals — pre-compression WebP backups.
apps/web/public/models/.ktx2-backup/

# ── Itachi memory/scratch "sync-hook drift" guard (2026-06-01) ──────────────
# An external Itachi sync (committed as "sync-hook drift from hoodie-prometh")
# kept copying memory + scratch .md notes into the repo root and apps/web, and
# even clobbered README.md with the slot-playground readme. ROOT is the canonical
# home for docs; the 12 negated below are the ONLY tracked root *.md. Everything
# else *.md at repo root — and ALL depth-1 *.md under apps/web — is drift and must
# never be committed. Un-ignoring a tracked file via "!" is safe and does NOT
# re-break the doc system (see the canonical-docs note above + CLAUDE.md).
/*.md
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/ARCHITECTURE.md
!/3dStructure.md
!/GameFeatures.md
!/WorldContent.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/ATTRIBUTION.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/TODO.md
!/VERIFICATION.md
!/SKILL.md
apps/web/*.md
# C6 meshopt+WebP pipeline originals — pre-C6 GLB/VRM backups (regeneratable).
# Revert a single file: git checkout 13480db -- apps/web/public/models/guide.glb
apps/web/public/.assets-backup/
.worktrees/

# Playwright MCP session artifacts
.playwright-mcp/
